The enrichment fetch isn't included. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and calling `https://metadata.internal.example/enrich` would need `aap:caps/http-client`, which is outside that authority. The world therefore imports only the inference interface. The output is unaffected.

